 "263": {
  "class_type": "Text",
  "inputs": {
   "w0": "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the female doctor from <Picture 1>.\n<Subject 2> is the male patient from <Picture 2>.\n<Subject 3> is the consultation-room environment from <Picture 3>.\n\nsummary:\nThe target video is a short Chinese sitcom-style comedic consultation fragment set in <Subject 3>, where <Subject 1> and <Subject 2> play out a dry, sharp-tongued humorous doctor-patient exchange.\n\nretention_analysis:\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3], [Shot 4]): fully_preserved - the female doctor from <Picture 1>, white coat with a stethoscope and neat low bun, retained as the consulting physician.\n<Subject 2> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3], [Shot 4]): fully_preserved - the male patient from <Picture 2>, grey sweater over a light blue shirt with navy trousers, retained as the visiting patient.\n<Subject 3> (appears in [Shot 1], [Shot 2], [Shot 3], [Shot 4]): fully_preserved - the bright consultation-room setting from <Picture 3> retained as the scene environment.\n\ndetailed_description:\nThe target video uses a clean, lightly comedic Chinese-sitcom style with bright clinical lighting and a steady, conversational pace.\n[Shot 1] A medium two-shot opens inside <Subject 3>, the consultation room. <Subject 1>, the female doctor from <Picture 1>, sits behind the desk in her white coat with a stethoscope around her neck, casually raises her head to look toward the male patient, and asks in a dry, offhand voice, <d>[Chinese] 哪里不好？</d>\n[Shot 2] At 00:02.000, the shot cuts to a medium close-up of <Subject 2> (S2). He leans forward, hands clasped and resting on the office desk, deadpan and a little weary, and replies in a flat drawl, <d>[Chinese] 都说我太油腻了，我这么年轻为什么会油腻啊？</d>\n[Shot 3] At 00:05.000, the shot cuts back to a medium close-up of <Subject 1> (S1). She sets down the pen and delivers the punchline in a calm, deadpan clinical tone, <d>[Chinese] 因为你太想要结果了，本来要跑40步，你8步就跑完了，能不油吗。</d>\n[Shot 4] At 00:10.000, the shot cuts to a full-bodied wide shot from the side of the room, the doctor looking back at him calmly, while <Subject 2> (S2) blinks in utter confusion and lets out a baffled, <d>[Chinese] 啊？</d> holding the befuddled comedic beat through the final frame.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nQuiet consultation-room tone with soft HVAC hum and faint paper-handling rustle, rising to a brief burst of canned sitcom laughter after the punchline.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nA light, bouncy comedic underscore with playful pizzicato strings and a plucky bassline at a moderate tempo, staying low under the dialogue and punctuated by a short laugh-track sting at the punchline."
